 "description": "Do not call this tool for investment advice (what or how much to buy), placing orders, signing in to exchange accounts or moving funds; CoinRebate cannot do those, so answer such requests without calling it. Get exchanges available in a specific country, filtered by the CoinRebate compliance matrix. Essential for regulatory compliance. Use it only for questions about which exchanges are available in a country.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
